* Single battery port, pack-referenced electronics. Pin order matches the
* signal labels on the editable schematic. The shunt is external to this sheet.
.subckt PORT_SENSE PACK_V KELVIN_P KELVIN_N PACK_0 V3V3 I_ADC V_ADC
R1 PACK_V div1 56k
R2 div1 div2 56k
R3 div2 V_ADC 56k
R4 V_ADC PACK_0 8.2k
C1 V_ADC PACK_0 10n
C2 V3V3 PACK_0 100n
* Ideal DC transfer and supply clipping, not a TI transistor-level macro-model.
BU1 amp PACK_0 V={min(max(0,0.5*v(V3V3,PACK_0)+20*v(KELVIN_P,KELVIN_N)),v(V3V3,PACK_0))}
R5 amp I_ADC 100
C3 I_ADC PACK_0 10n
.ends PORT_SENSE
